{"4153300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Off-Road Pumpkin Carriage", "steam_appid": 4153300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and Let's Plays Welcome!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A straight-line pumpkin carriage race where each tire moves independently!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153300/extras/a4b4d4e69d86d38955113fc62f62f29c.poster.avif?t=1764517742\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153300/extras/a4b4d4e69d86d38955113fc62f62f29c.webm?t=1764517742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153300/extras/a4b4d4e69d86d38955113fc62f62f29c.mp4?t=1764517742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your carriage toward the parking space far off in the distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>left stick</strong> controls the <strong>left wheel</strong>, and the <strong>right stick</strong> controls the <strong>right wheel</strong>.<br>Move them forward or backward to turn left or right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome rough terrain and go forth, mighty 4WD Pumpkin Carriage!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>4 players</strong> can play simultaneously!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In multiplayer mode, <strong>two players share control of one carriage</strong>, each handling different wheels.<br>For example, Player 1 controls the left side, while Player 2 controls the right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don’t coordinate your movements, the carriage might go in completely unexpected directions!<br>Work together and hurry to the goal!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Magic Effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witch who created the pumpkin carriage left behind all kinds of magical effects along the road —<br>whether to use them or avoid them is up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔴 Red – <strong>Tall Pumpkin</strong><br>🟣 Purple – <strong>Stretchy Pumpkin</strong><br>🔵 Blue – <strong>Giant Pumpkin</strong><br>🟢 Green – <strong>Flat Pumpkin</strong><br>🟡 Yellow – <strong>Turbo Pumpkin</strong><br>💗 Pink – <strong>Bouncy Pumpkin</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to each situation and steer your pumpkin wisely!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and Let's Plays Welcome!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A straight-line pumpkin carriage race where each tire moves independently!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153300/extras/a4b4d4e69d86d38955113fc62f62f29c.poster.avif?t=1764517742\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153300/extras/a4b4d4e69d86d38955113fc62f62f29c.webm?t=1764517742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153300/extras/a4b4d4e69d86d38955113fc62f62f29c.mp4?t=1764517742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your carriage toward the parking space far off in the distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>left stick</strong> controls the <strong>left wheel</strong>, and the <strong>right stick</strong> controls the <strong>right wheel</strong>.<br>Move them forward or backward to turn left or right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome rough terrain and go forth, mighty 4WD Pumpkin Carriage!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>4 players</strong> can play simultaneously!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In multiplayer mode, <strong>two players share control of one carriage</strong>, each handling different wheels.<br>For example, Player 1 controls the left side, while Player 2 controls the right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don’t coordinate your movements, the carriage might go in completely unexpected directions!<br>Work together and hurry to the goal!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Magic Effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witch who created the pumpkin carriage left behind all kinds of magical effects along the road —<br>whether to use them or avoid them is up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔴 Red – <strong>Tall Pumpkin</strong><br>🟣 Purple – <strong>Stretchy Pumpkin</strong><br>🔵 Blue – <strong>Giant Pumpkin</strong><br>🟢 Green – <strong>Flat Pumpkin</strong><br>🟡 Yellow – <strong>Turbo Pumpkin</strong><br>💗 Pink – <strong>Bouncy Pumpkin</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to each situation and steer your pumpkin wisely!</p>", "short_description": "Control the pumpkin carriage and make your way to the ball. But each wheel must be operated independently! Up to four players can play simultaneously!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153300/ba6b180d0aedb0b6b7ca76c22981430a88c366c2/header.jpg?t=1764517742", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153300/2caf6620b234de3a038724671f8dc917c5fc822b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764517742", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153300/2caf6620b234de3a038724671f8dc917c5fc822b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764517742", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["NoraPerikaProject"], "publishers": ["NoraPerikaProject"], "price_overview": {"curre